{"id":"word:hebrew:H8549","type":"word","title":"תָּמִים","subtitle":"H8549 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"entire (literally, figuratively or morally); also (as noun) integrity , truth","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תָּמִים (H8549) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 91 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תָּמִים (tâmîym) means entire (literally, figuratively or morally); also (as noun) integrity , truth First listed occurrence: 1Sam 14 41."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תָּמִים","transliteration":"tâmîym","pronunciation":"taw-meem'","strong":"H8549","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8549","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["תְּמִימִֽם","תָּמִ֖ים","תָּמִ֣ים","תָּמִֽים","תְּמִימִ֖ם"],"morphs":[["HAamsa",45],["HAampa",26],["HAafsa",8],["HC/Aampa",3],["HAamsc",2],["HR/Aamsa",2],["HC/R/Aamsa",2],["HAampc",2],["HAafpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"entire (literally, figuratively or morally); also (as noun) integrity , truth","usage":"without blemish, complete, full, perfect, sincerely (-ity), sound, without spot, undefiled, upright(-ly), whole.","full":"H8549. tamim תָּמִים 91 adjective complete, sound ; — ׳ת Gen 6:9 +; feminine תְּמִימָה Lev 3:9 +; construct תְּמִים Job 36:4 ; 37:16 ; plural תְּמִימִים Ezek 43:25 +; תְּמִימֹת Lev 23:15 ; construct תְּמִימֵי Psa 119:1 ; Prov 11:20 ; &#8212; 1 complete, whole, entire , Job 36:4 דֵעוֺת תְּמִים , 37:16 . 2 whole, sound healthful , of men Prov 1:12 (|| חַיִּים ); vine Ezek 15:5 ; usually of sacrificial P, P; Exod 12:5 40 t., so Ezek 43:22 10 t. 3 complete, entire , of time: day Josh 10:13 ; year Lev 25:30 ; Sabbaths 23:15 . 4 sound, wholesome, unimpaired, innocent, having integrity: of God's way Psa 18:31 = 2Sam 22:31 ; work Deut 32:4 ; law Psa 19:8 ; elsewhere of man Gen 6:9 ; 17:1 (P; both || אלהים (לִפְנֵי) אֵת הִתְהַלֵח ); ׳ת י ׳עם Deut 18:13 ; Psa 18:24 , with ל in || 2Sam 22:24 ; often with דֶּרֶח way: ת ׳דֶּרֶח Psa 101:2 ; ׳ת בִּדְרָכֶ֫יךָ Ezek 28:15 ; דָ֑רֶח תְּמִימֵי Prov 11:20 ; Psa 119:1 ; ת ׳וַיַּתֵּר דרכו 2Sam 22:33 || דַּרְכִּי ת ׳וַיִּתֵּן Psa 18:33 ; ת בדרך ׳הלך 101:6 ; דֶּרֶח omitted, תמים הלך , Prov 28:18 ; Psa 15:2 ; ת ׳לב 119:80 ; = noun (late), man of integrity Prov 11:5 ; Job 12:4 ; plural Prov 2:21 ; 28:10 ; Psa 37:18 . 5 as neuter adjective = substantive what is complete, entirely in accord with truth and fact: ת בֵר ׳דֹּ Amos 5:10 ; וּבְת עֲשִׂיתֶם׳אִםבֶּֿאֱמֶת Judg 9:16 , 19 ; ׳י ׳בְּת וּבֶאֱמֶת עִבְדוּ Josh 24:14 (E); integrity ת ׳גְּבַר Psa 18:26 (construct Ges § 93s ; || 2Sam 22:26 גִּבּוֺת ), 2Sam 84:12; בְּת ׳הֹלְכִים . — 1Sam 14:41 see תֹּם 4","rootNote":"from 8552 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 14 41","keyReferences":["1Sam 14 41","2Sam 22 24","2Sam 22 26","2Sam 22 31","2Sam 22 33","Amos 5 10","Deut 18 13","Deut 32 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":91,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 14 41","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תָמִ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 24","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תָמִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 26","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תָּמִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 31","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תָּמִ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 33","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תָּמִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Amos 5 10","book":"Amos","chapter":5,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תָּמִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Deut 18 13","book":"Deut","chapter":18,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תּ